    "type": "game",
    "name": "Incredibug",
    "steam_appid": 3604920,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incredibug is a colorful 3D platformer that combines fun platforming mechanics and heroic moments with a heartwarming story about friendship, teamwork, and the clash between nature and technology. You'll control Bobo, an unassuming pill bug who rises as a hero to defend the local critter community when their home is threatened by an AI-powered Smart Home system. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accompanied by Lumi the firefly and Ronald Roach, you explore various environments\u2014inside the robot-infested house, the garden, and underground\u2014solving puzzles and battling robotic enemies while rolling and bouncing through a familiar world with a new perspective. With the help of unique bug allies, each offering special abilities, you'll traverse the world like a true superhero. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/1664107efe49adc0c4ae2b4fc509e750.avif?t=1755269233\" data-has-big width=1600 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a pill bug, you'll </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll, Bounce  and Crawl around in a fun, physics-based movement system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb nearly anything and explore the secrets of the smart home and garden</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/e08542a805a725085409b342dbe0d5fe.avif?t=1755269233\" data-has-big width=1600 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since you'll make plenty of friends on your journey, you can collect their entries in your friendship journal and they'll teach you tricks like</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungbeetle-crafted explosives that blow things up and boost you to new heights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swinging through the world with a Grappling-Hook made of flexible spider silk</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blinding the minions of the metal menace using Lumi's firefly abilities</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/1396a671042fecaa5c03edcf69141f3a.avif?t=1755269233\" data-has-big width=1600 height=183 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a friend and let them play as Lumi the firefly and use her abilities to support Bobo in an accessible 1.5 player coop mode that rewards teamwork with unique mechanics:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amplify Bobo's abilities and speed at any time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world in free-flight mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pester enemies (or your friend) and distract the cleaning robots to protect your friend</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine Lumi's abilities with Bobo's and experiment with powerful interactions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Funding</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The development of this game's concept was funded by &quot;FilmFernsehFonds Bayern&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/c2ab957d994d91f7413421a60aab241e.avif?t=1755269233\" width=552 height=140 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incredibug is a colorful 3D platformer that combines fun platforming mechanics and heroic moments with a heartwarming story about friendship, teamwork, and the clash between nature and technology. You'll control Bobo, an unassuming pill bug who rises as a hero to defend the local critter community when their home is threatened by an AI-powered Smart Home system. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accompanied by Lumi the firefly and Ronald Roach, you explore various environments\u2014inside the robot-infested house, the garden, and underground\u2014solving puzzles and battling robotic enemies while rolling and bouncing through a familiar world with a new perspective. With the help of unique bug allies, each offering special abilities, you'll traverse the world like a true superhero. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/1664107efe49adc0c4ae2b4fc509e750.avif?t=1755269233\" data-has-big width=1600 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a pill bug, you'll </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll, Bounce  and Crawl around in a fun, physics-based movement system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb nearly anything and explore the secrets of the smart home and garden</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/e08542a805a725085409b342dbe0d5fe.avif?t=1755269233\" data-has-big width=1600 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since you'll make plenty of friends on your journey, you can collect their entries in your friendship journal and they'll teach you tricks like</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungbeetle-crafted explosives that blow things up and boost you to new heights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swinging through the world with a Grappling-Hook made of flexible spider silk</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blinding the minions of the metal menace using Lumi's firefly abilities</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/1396a671042fecaa5c03edcf69141f3a.avif?t=1755269233\" data-has-big width=1600 height=183 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a friend and let them play as Lumi the firefly and use her abilities to support Bobo in an accessible 1.5 player coop mode that rewards teamwork with unique mechanics:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amplify Bobo's abilities and speed at any time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world in free-flight mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pester enemies (or your friend) and distract the cleaning robots to protect your friend</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine Lumi's abilities with Bobo's and experiment with powerful interactions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Funding</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The development of this game's concept was funded by &quot;FilmFernsehFonds Bayern&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/c2ab957d994d91f7413421a60aab241e.avif?t=1755269233\" width=552 height=140 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Become the Incredibug: Control a cute pill bug, unite your fellow critters and rise up against a menacing smart home system in this physics-based platformer with metroidvania elements. Play together with a friend and let them support you as Lumi the firefly in our cozy 1.5 player couch-coop",
